2026-08-25T00:00:01Z (RFD66606-2028) 'Each component takes an entities, repositories and datasources layout.
 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD2028  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:02Z (RFD66606-2028) 'Components in the stack span several languages (C, C++, Python, Elixir, GDScript), run as separate processes, and each binds to hardware, a GPU, the network, or an engine runtime. A component has to stay testable without its device, replaceable without a rewrite of its callers, and composable with components written in another language.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2028  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:03Z (RFD66606-2028) 'Read RFD66606-2111 next, which defines the service that components compose into.
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD2028  1 LINE
 Text:Written

